      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そういう言葉を聞くために\r\n私は武器を作っているんだって。",
        "official_en": "Yeah. Weird, right? She said the whole reason she made that weapon was to hear those words.",
        "real_en": "She said she makes weapons to hear words like that."
