      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "でも、みんなは言うのよ。\r\n砂漠は魔物がいて危険だから行くなって。",
        "official_en": "But folks kept telling about monsters in the desert—told me it’s too dangerous to go out there.",
        "real_en": null
